+# Tool Input Validation
+
+| Field  | Value                |
+| ------ | -------------------- |
+| Issue  | re-cinq/HALEngine#37 |
+| Status | Draft                |
+
+`ToolRegistry.execute` validates input against the registered tool's `inputSchema` before invoking the executor; rejected input is returned as a tool result and the executor is not called ([validated by: rejects missing required input before invoking the executor](../../src/orchestration/tools/registry.acceptance.test.ts#L4)).
